==Portuguese==
{{wikipedia|lang=pt}}
[[file:Bahia in Brazil.svg|thumb|Bahia]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|pt|Baía||dated in Brazil|occasionally used in Portugal}}

===Etymology===
From earlier {{m|pt|Bahia de Todos os Santos||Bay of All Saints}}, after a bay on its coast. {{m|pt|bahia}} is an obsolete spelling of {{m|pt|baía||bay}}; the name of the state was specially mentioned as an example of the exception for traditional placenames in the spelling reform that proscribed &lt;h&gt; between vowels.

